    featuredImagePrompt: "A dynamic, abstract conceptual image representing medical breakthroughs and hope. The composition features glowing neural pathways subtly forming a brain-like structure, intertwined with stylized DNA helix elements, and microscopic cellular structures emanating a soft, healing, energetic aura. The color palette emphasizes deep blues, vibrant greens, and shimmering gold highlights against a dark, futuristic background, conveying innovation and a future-forward perspective. The image should feel expansive and optimistic, avoiding any literal depiction of disease or human figures. Emphasize scientific interconnectedness and the promise of discovery.",
