    risks: ["Increased regulatory scrutiny on crypto-funded political activities.", "Potential for negative public perception regarding lobbying efforts.", "Volatility in crypto markets impacting consistent PAC funding.", "Unpredictability of political outcomes despite funding.", "Risk of misinterpretation of crypto\'s environmental commitment.", "Indirect impact on Indian regulatory environment based on global precedents."],
