    outlook: "The outlook suggests an increasing trend of political engagement by the cryptocurrency sector, moving beyond traditional finance to influence broader societal and environmental policies. While the \'Retribution Tour\' PAC\'s immediate impact is US-centric, its success could serve as a blueprint for similar initiatives globally, including potentially in India, where the nexus of energy policy and digital assets is still evolving. This points to a future where crypto\'s influence extends deeply into political discourse, driving conversations around sustainability and innovation.",
