      bearCase: "The bearish outlook centers on persistent macroeconomic uncertainty, including high interest rates and inflation, which could suppress risk appetite for speculative assets like Bitcoin. Gracy Chen\'s range-bound forecast reflects this. Tightening global regulations, increased enforcement actions, and the absence of major new institutional catalysts like direct US government purchases could further constrain upward price movement.",
